  «text (900,2150) 1 7 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿// voltage controller parameters (Op-Amp)\n.param R0=9e3\n.param R1=85e3\n.param C1=1.1e-9\n.param R2=120e3\n.param C2=2.7e-9\n.param R4=47e3\n.param Vref_op_amp = Vref*R4/(R0+R1+R4)"»
