  «text (-1000,3600) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Functional equivalence as demo from PLECS, Power Supplies > Buck Converter with Voltage Controls\n(buck_converter_with_voltage_controls.plecs)\nby KSKelvin on 7-26-2026\nCustom Symbol download: https://github.com/KSKelvin-Github/Qspice"»
