  «text (4750,2450) 1 7 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿// continuous Transfer Function\n.param Kc = R2/(R0+R1)/Vref_op_amp;\n.param Tnum = R1*C1;\n.param Tden = R0*R1*C1/(R0+R1);\n.param Ki = 1/(R2*C2);"»
